  "contentHtml": "<P>&nbsp;2013년 학생들의 수업평가서입니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DI6d%26dataid%3D10%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20140301102452&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile284.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F26714638531136D3060CBC')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> ST의 수업평가서(2013).hwp</a></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>올해 2014년&nbsp;제 수업에서 </P>\r\n<P>계속 유지할 부분은</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;1. <SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">매시간 학습지 검사하고(15초 법칙),&nbsp;그린마일리지 상점 부여</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;2. 매시간 집중 점수 주기</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;3. 성취기준표 제시</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;4. 시험전 핵심요약정리 만들게 하기</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;5. 맛있는 간식 제공^^&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;6. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">과학노래 많이 알려주기</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;7. 교사의 긍정적이고 밝은 태도 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;8. 매시간 20명의 학생 이름 부르기</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제 수업에서 개선해야 할 부분은</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">1. 수업 분위기를 해치는 학생들에 대한 적극적인 대처</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">2. JIGSAW 2 수업에서 전문가 집단이 맡은 과제를 적극적으로 해오는 것&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">3. 매시간 부여한 보너스 점수의 활용법</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">올해 제가 해보고 싶은 수업은</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">1. 백지학습지 : 스스로 공부한 내용을 정리해보게 하는 것!</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>2. 경청기술 향상</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">입니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2557B838531135C32D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"522\" style=\"WIDTH: 522px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636053978.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"801\"  id=\"A_2557B838531135C32D953C\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/226D2538531135C303\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"515\" height=\"801\" style=\"WIDTH: 515px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 801px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636104603.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_226D2538531135C303B5B6\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21702038531135CE26\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"526\" style=\"WIDTH: 526px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636155513.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"801\"  id=\"A_21702038531135CE2679B4\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25180B38531135CF1D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"520\" style=\"WIDTH: 520px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636172536.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"801\"  id=\"A_25180B38531135CF1D8BB0\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25714638531135D002\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"521\" height=\"801\" style=\"WIDTH: 521px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 801px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636192718.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_25714638531135D0023F03\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26550938531135D12D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"602\" height=\"801\" style=\"WIDTH: 602px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 801px; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636222529.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_26550938531135D12DC043\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2457003B531135D218\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"549\" style=\"WIDTH: 549px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"1393636245076.jpg\" actualwidth=\"451\" exif=\"{}\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"801\"  id=\"A_2457003B531135D2181275\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
